: STAGEL N:D: CORE FIXTURE :CHAR:EA:SEE SRC/FORMATS/STAGEL/DOCS/SLN:D:.MD FOR FULL SPECIFICATION:CHAR:EB:.
: EXERCISES COMMENTS:CHAR:EE: :CHAR:DE:.:CHAR:DE: / :CHAR:DE:.:CHAR:DE: TERMINATORS:CHAR:EE: :CHAR:DE::CHAR:BCF::CHAR:DE: :CHAR:EF::CHAR:GC: :CHAR:DE::::CHAR:DE::CHAR:EE: LET/SET/CONST:CHAR:EE: LITERALS:CHAR:EE: LEXICAL CAPTURE:CHAR:EE: AND MUTUAL TAIL CALLS.

V/B/ISEMPTY L/UN:D:N:C:/ITEMS
    TEST WORKS WITH EMPTY LIST
        IN L/UN:D:N:C:: ::
        OUT TRUE
    TEST WORKS WITH NONEMPTY LIST
        IN L/UN:D:N:C:: UN:D:N:C::N:H: ::
        OUT FALSE
    EQ UN:G:N:E::N:A: LEN L/UN:D:N:C:/ITEMS.

V/B/NNE IN:G:N:E:/A IN:G:N:E:/B :: NE IN:G:N:E:/A IN:G:N:E:/B.
V/B/NNESEMICOLON IN:G:N:E:/A IN:G:N:E:/B :: NE IN:G:N:E:/A IN:G:N:E:/B.
V/UN:D:N:C:/BRACEBLOCK UN:D:N:C:/X :: DO UN:D:N:C:/X. ::

V/UN:D:N:C:/MODSTEP UN:D:N:C:/A UN:D:N:C:/B
    TEST COMPUTES UNSIGNED MODULUS
        IN UN:D:N:C::N:B:N:H: UN:D:N:C::N:F:
        OUT UN:D:N:C::N:C:
    MOD UN:D:N:C:/A UN:D:N:C:/B.

V/L/UN:D:N:C:/APPENDUN:D:N:C: L/UN:D:N:C:/A L/UN:D:N:C:/B
    TEST CONCATENATES TWO LISTS
        IN L/UN:D:N:C:: UN:D:N:C::N:A: UN:D:N:C::N:B: :: L/UN:D:N:C:: UN:D:N:C::N:C: UN:D:N:C::N:D: ::
        OUT L/UN:D:N:C:: UN:D:N:C::N:A: UN:D:N:C::N:B: UN:D:N:C::N:C: UN:D:N:C::N:D: ::
    CONCAT L/UN:D:N:C:/A L/UN:D:N:C:/B.

V/L/T/SPLITLETTERS T/SEP T/INPUT
    TEST SPLITS CASE NORMALIZED LETTERS
        IN T"B" T"ABC"
        OUT L/T: T"A" T"C" ::
    EXPLODE T/SEP T/INPUT.

V/L/UN:I:/ROUNDTRIPBYTES L/UN:I:/SEP L/UN:I:/INPUT
    TEST SPLITS AND REJOINS CASE PRESERVING BYTE SLICES
        IN B"//" B"A/XGC/XGD///XGE/XGF/XGG/XFM/N"
        OUT B"A/XGC/XGD///XGE/XGF/XGG/XFM/N"
    CONST L/L/UN:I:/PARTS EXPLODE L/UN:I:/SEP L/UN:I:/INPUT.
    IMPLODE L/UN:I:/SEP L/L/UN:I:/PARTS.

: UNINITIALIZED LET MUST BE DEFINITELY ASSIGNED VIA SET BEFORE ANY READ. CONST IS IMMUTABLE.
V/UN:D:N:C:/DEFINITEINIT B/PICKFIRST UN:D:N:C:/A UN:D:N:C:/B
    TEST INITIALIZES IN BOTH BRANCHES BEFORE READING
        IN FALSE UN:D:N:C::N:D: UN:D:N:C::N:I:
        OUT UN:D:N:C::N:B:N:I:
    CONST UN:D:N:C:/BONUS UN:D:N:C::N:B:N:A:.
    LET UN:D:N:C:/CHOSEN.
    IF B/PICKFIRST
        SET UN:D:N:C:/CHOSEN UN:D:N:C:/A
        SET UN:D:N:C:/CHOSEN UN:D:N:C:/B.
    ADD UN:D:N:C:/CHOSEN UN:D:N:C:/BONUS.

: NESTED VERB CAPTURES DEFINITION:CHAR:EF:SITE MUTABLE LET BINDING EVEN WHEN CALLED FROM A SIBLING VERB.
V/UN:D:N:C:/LEXICALCAPTURE UN:D:N:C:/INITIAL
    TEST READS SHARED BINDING AFTER MUTATION
        IN UN:D:N:C::N:H:
        OUT UN:D:N:C::N:J:
    LET UN:D:N:C:/CAPTURED UN:D:N:C:/INITIAL.
    V/UN:D:N:C:/READCAPTURED :: UN:D:N:C:/CAPTURED.
    V/UN:D:N:C:/CALLFROMSIBLING
        CONST UN:D:N:C:/CALLERLOCAL UN:D:N:C::N:J:N:J:.
        READCAPTURED.
    SET UN:D:N:C:/CAPTURED UN:D:N:C::N:J:.
    CALLFROMSIBLING.

: BOTH DIRECTIONS OF THIS MUTUAL RECURSION ARE TAIL CALLS:CHAR:EE: INCLUDING THROUGH IF BRANCHES.
V/B/TAILFIRST B/STOP
    TEST TAKES MUTUAL TAIL CALL
        IN FALSE
        OUT FALSE
    IF B/STOP TRUE TAILSECOND TRUE.
V/B/TAILSECOND B/STOP :: IF B/STOP FALSE TAILFIRST TRUE.

: LET:CHAR:EE: SET:CHAR:EE: AND FOREACH RETURN UNIT OF TYPE VOID. THE FINAL EXPRESSION RETURNS THE COPIED LIST.
V/L/UN:D:N:C:/COPYLIST L/UN:D:N:C:/ITEMS
    TEST COPIES LIST SNAPSHOT
        IN L/UN:D:N:C:: UN:D:N:C::N:C: UN:D:N:C::N:D: ::
        OUT L/UN:D:N:C:: UN:D:N:C::N:C: UN:D:N:C::N:D: ::
    LET L/UN:D:N:C:/COPIED L/UN:D:N:C:: ::.
    FOREACH L/UN:D:N:C:/ITEMS DO
        SET L/UN:D:N:C:/COPIED CONCAT L/UN:D:N:C:/COPIED L/UN:D:N:C:: UN:D:N:C:/THIS ::.
    ::.
    L/UN:D:N:C:/COPIED.

: EMPTY DO BLOCKS RETURN UNIT OF TYPE VOID.
V/VOID/UNITCHOICE B/CONDITION :: IF B/CONDITION DO :: DO ::.
